    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***TURN KEY PROPERTIES - ALL FLOORING (subject to contracts signed and exchanged within 28 days of receiving)/KITCHEN/WHITE GOODS/WARDROBES INCLUDED***\r\n\r\n4 Bed Semi-Detached New Build Property\r\n\r\n***Help to Buy/First Home scheme approved***\r\n\r\nDrayton is a brand-new residential development by the highly respected Cannon Kirk Group. \r\nConsisting of 2, 3 & 4 bed properties with an A1 energy efficiency rating.\r\nLocated just 2km west of the picturesque village of Blackrock and 4km south of Dundalk.\r\n\r\nDundalk is the perfect location for commuters as it is has trainlines/buses running directly to Dublin and Drayton is also located a few minutes away from the M1 motorway making it so much easier for commuting.  Dublin airport is also only a forty minute drive away from our location.\r\n\r\nBlackrock village is full on amenities such as pubs, restaurants, coffee shops, music shop/school, gift shops, pharmacies, schools, creches and more, making it a perfect neighbouring village to visit and easily got to on foot. It is the perfect location to be beside as there are always fun events on during the year for every age category such as raft races, charity music events, races etc. Drayton aims to give a homely yet stylish new way of living by having PV panels, heat pumps and beautiful double glazed windows to keep your home feeling warm but looking stylish for years to come. With our properties in Drayton we have made sure to utilise any area that was wasted/unused space and turned it into storage as we know that it is vital for homeowners. \r\n\r\n\r\nGet in touch with us so we can help you on your new home journey here in Drayton!\r\n\r\n\r\nContact Kevin on 086 259 0505\r\n\r\nPotential purchasers are specifically advised to verify the floor areas as part of their due diligence. Pictures/maps/dimensions are for illustration purposes only and potential purchasers should satisfy themselves of final finish and unit/land areas. Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only. The property is sold as seen and a purchaser is to satisfy themselves of same when bidding"
      },
